{"4868880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Medieval Journey", "steam_appid": 4868880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/e4d2a2b15c5996ddd7c2dd513b941fde.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/e4d2a2b15c5996ddd7c2dd513b941fde.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/f91a203b2d5862351686f96546ea78cb.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living medieval MMORPG where generations rise and fall. Build relationships, marry, raise children and continue your family's story through the ages. Master professions, create thriving businesses and explore authentic cities inspired by medieval Germany.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/29dc0e6e6b05568798af4f2b34e84638.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚜ Build a Dynasty Across Generations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚒ Master Professions and Create Thriving Businesses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏛 Explore Historical German Cities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 Forge Relationships, Marry and Raise a Family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 Leave a Legacy That Outlives You</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/f7c2f241f2c0239c21cebee54497833a.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Life in medieval Germany is yours to shape.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a craftsman, merchant or adventurer and build your place in a living world inspired by real historical cities. Form lasting relationships, establish your trade and create a legacy that grows beyond a single lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you seek wealth, prestige or simply a life worth remembering, every choice you make helps shape the future of your family and the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/1ee6afba45404235cb7ef9b3c3eea899.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/c04f3d4120fb9472a439c184194443a0.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In The Medieval Journey, you are not just creating a character—you are founding a family.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships, find a partner and raise children who inherit your name, wealth and reputation. As the years pass, your character grows old, but your story doesn't end. Continue your journey as the next generation and watch your family's legacy unfold across the centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two dynasties are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/1047f341da78276a4a36a2871848f4d1.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/1047f341da78276a4a36a2871848f4d1.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/7f77bf89a6a5c6cbd81748318c968c96.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/f566a37ecd8ecedf88386e69eba16c94.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/f566a37ecd8ecedf88386e69eba16c94.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=784 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/7be27cf3f0ec609a4652f1d49c870dae.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a world inspired by real historical cities and experience medieval Germany brought to life. Begin your journey in the thriving cities of Magdeburg, Lübeck, Hamburg and Lüneburg, each offering its own character, industries and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the realm grows, new regions and cities—including Cologne, Trier and Nuremberg—will expand the world even further, creating new stories, trade routes and adventures to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/7e3c7aceef27e75c68e4408624bbf033.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/9f3bc29e9240fdbec21d812ceb904bad.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/9f3bc29e9240fdbec21d812ceb904bad.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=783 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/1481d08708e123b527ac6894cbafe84d.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, cultivate the land, brew ale or establish thriving workshops. In The Medieval Journey, every profession plays a role in the world and offers its own path to wealth and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, master your craft and build businesses that can support your family for generations. Whether you become a renowned blacksmith, a prosperous merchant or a respected physician, your trade becomes part of your legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/2a352911b0320d41344d4372da00e786.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather and Harvest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, mines and fields to obtain the resources that fuel the realm. Fell mighty trees, extract precious ore, cultivate fertile land or hunt in the wilderness to supply craftsmen and merchants alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/95a3133aa0cb28751b44ac9ecc6208bf.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/5cb72b3d60eb357fe126095e3a631a07.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/85f62e2bb5f2a188192ae81ee1b7b2dc.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/332fc12effa460bad06d738cb40a6c46.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/9f62eaf08d244fa2991f65c1ca27d534.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farmer                 Miner                  Forester               Hunter                 Fisher</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Master your Craft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn raw materials into valuable goods. Forge weapons and armor, tailor clothing, brew fine beverages, craft furniture or develop rare recipes through years of experience and dedication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/6630d19c8ad93dcb87f3305f78385da2.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/1cb21aed9a6fb42a5febab995a071121.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/d4d1fbb9a947fcae3574285b64f84213.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/c29fbb94f53a9d36e30c4a59f7e1fbf4.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/23d3cbd71c9a29fba360f8bc4dfb6759.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/fcca3fb9489f52e2ad764ff6a5edf371.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/e5088f5fe6b5357b74eb5ac56a7c4575.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baker                   Barrelbinder        Butcher               Furrier                 Goldsmith            Stonemason        Weaponsmith</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade and Build Your Fortune</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport goods between cities, discover profitable opportunities and establish thriving businesses. Master the art of commerce, organize trade routes and grow your wealth through skill, reputation and smart investments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/9ea91cb1a336d190aa01cf82adf26127.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/c7ca93541ad0d3672dab053f99242854.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/3457137ba40835a061c75517bc9030f8.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/d828eb81c9259e80709ec0c6ed7bca9b.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/ebd194a6ba0d5a96292d94b3ed664d76.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/7427ecdbff26c5924d120ee80bf1c1a1.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/304bf52a8bb443d762c6cec140c653e8.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonings          Luxuries              Sundries              Fabrics                Livestock             Alcohol               Weapons</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >and many more...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/14ed4c5b12d782979f1575dbe864a440.poster.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1170 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/14ed4c5b12d782979f1575dbe864a440.webm?t=1787509442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/14ed4c5b12d782979f1575dbe864a440.mp4?t=1787509442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/4c70a058c418652e17a05a8f1008a381.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/a428c74042006bdf905fa1ab7486f7f9.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wealth in The Medieval Journey is not created in isolation, but through a living world driven by players, supply and demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources vary in value between regions, creating opportunities for craftsmen and traders alike. What is abundant in one city may be rare and highly sought after in another. By mastering production, understanding markets and moving goods across trade routes, you can build a fortune through strategy rather than combat alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From raw materials to finished goods, from local workshops to long-distance caravans—every step of the economy is shaped by the people who live in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/f958acd610a7df010fd90d031e0df6f2.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/02055be2962c9733f604e49ca1b0c00f.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/02055be2962c9733f604e49ca1b0c00f.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=831 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/12e918202863001e73765d36ef13c780.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey from humble beginnings and grow into a life defined by success, reputation and influence. Own property, run businesses and accumulate wealth that shapes not only your own future, but also that of your descendants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As generations pass, your family continues what you have built—expanding its reach, preserving its name and growing its legacy across the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/8573bd53634e945594262e7dae5491c6.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/5d7a9dd5f860431cc7e2057060779dec.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Medieval Journey is more than a solo experience—it is a living world shaped by its community. Form guilds, establish trade networks and build alliances that influence the economy and social landscape of entire regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with others to craft, trade and explore, or compete for influence across cities and markets. Every interaction contributes to a world that evolves through the actions of its players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/aa2a3eb4fa19ae997ec306b7b9e0370e.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/859668fa656f77b993cfda60cb1ed295.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Multi-Generational Dynasty System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Marriage, Children and Inheritance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Character Aging and Permanent Legacy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Historical Medieval German Cities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Deep Profession and Crafting Systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Player-Driven Economy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Regional Trading Networks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Dynamic Social Relationships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Family Reputation and Influence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Cooperative Multiplayer Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Guilds and Alliances</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Persistent Online World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/17f096d16ac0fe8456d437dbaed7c033.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You may begin as a simple blacksmith.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your grandson may become the wealthiest merchant in the realm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your family name may be remembered for centuries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Medieval Journey is not the story of a single hero.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It is the story of a dynasty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/9c8533577e7eb2a634d0599eb9de4870.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/9c8533577e7eb2a634d0599eb9de4870.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=779 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/e4d2a2b15c5996ddd7c2dd513b941fde.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/e4d2a2b15c5996ddd7c2dd513b941fde.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/f91a203b2d5862351686f96546ea78cb.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living medieval MMORPG where generations rise and fall. Build relationships, marry, raise children and continue your family's story through the ages. Master professions, create thriving businesses and explore authentic cities inspired by medieval Germany.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/29dc0e6e6b05568798af4f2b34e84638.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚜ Build a Dynasty Across Generations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚒ Master Professions and Create Thriving Businesses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏛 Explore Historical German Cities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 Forge Relationships, Marry and Raise a Family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 Leave a Legacy That Outlives You</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/f7c2f241f2c0239c21cebee54497833a.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Life in medieval Germany is yours to shape.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a craftsman, merchant or adventurer and build your place in a living world inspired by real historical cities. Form lasting relationships, establish your trade and create a legacy that grows beyond a single lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you seek wealth, prestige or simply a life worth remembering, every choice you make helps shape the future of your family and the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/1ee6afba45404235cb7ef9b3c3eea899.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/c04f3d4120fb9472a439c184194443a0.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In The Medieval Journey, you are not just creating a character—you are founding a family.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships, find a partner and raise children who inherit your name, wealth and reputation. As the years pass, your character grows old, but your story doesn't end. Continue your journey as the next generation and watch your family's legacy unfold across the centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two dynasties are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/1047f341da78276a4a36a2871848f4d1.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/1047f341da78276a4a36a2871848f4d1.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/7f77bf89a6a5c6cbd81748318c968c96.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/f566a37ecd8ecedf88386e69eba16c94.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/f566a37ecd8ecedf88386e69eba16c94.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=784 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/7be27cf3f0ec609a4652f1d49c870dae.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a world inspired by real historical cities and experience medieval Germany brought to life. Begin your journey in the thriving cities of Magdeburg, Lübeck, Hamburg and Lüneburg, each offering its own character, industries and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the realm grows, new regions and cities—including Cologne, Trier and Nuremberg—will expand the world even further, creating new stories, trade routes and adventures to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/7e3c7aceef27e75c68e4408624bbf033.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/9f3bc29e9240fdbec21d812ceb904bad.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/9f3bc29e9240fdbec21d812ceb904bad.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=783 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/1481d08708e123b527ac6894cbafe84d.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, cultivate the land, brew ale or establish thriving workshops. In The Medieval Journey, every profession plays a role in the world and offers its own path to wealth and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, master your craft and build businesses that can support your family for generations. Whether you become a renowned blacksmith, a prosperous merchant or a respected physician, your trade becomes part of your legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/2a352911b0320d41344d4372da00e786.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather and Harvest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, mines and fields to obtain the resources that fuel the realm. Fell mighty trees, extract precious ore, cultivate fertile land or hunt in the wilderness to supply craftsmen and merchants alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/95a3133aa0cb28751b44ac9ecc6208bf.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/5cb72b3d60eb357fe126095e3a631a07.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/85f62e2bb5f2a188192ae81ee1b7b2dc.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/332fc12effa460bad06d738cb40a6c46.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/9f62eaf08d244fa2991f65c1ca27d534.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farmer                 Miner                  Forester               Hunter                 Fisher</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Master your Craft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn raw materials into valuable goods. Forge weapons and armor, tailor clothing, brew fine beverages, craft furniture or develop rare recipes through years of experience and dedication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/6630d19c8ad93dcb87f3305f78385da2.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/1cb21aed9a6fb42a5febab995a071121.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/d4d1fbb9a947fcae3574285b64f84213.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/c29fbb94f53a9d36e30c4a59f7e1fbf4.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/23d3cbd71c9a29fba360f8bc4dfb6759.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/fcca3fb9489f52e2ad764ff6a5edf371.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/e5088f5fe6b5357b74eb5ac56a7c4575.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baker                   Barrelbinder        Butcher               Furrier                 Goldsmith            Stonemason        Weaponsmith</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade and Build Your Fortune</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport goods between cities, discover profitable opportunities and establish thriving businesses. Master the art of commerce, organize trade routes and grow your wealth through skill, reputation and smart investments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/9ea91cb1a336d190aa01cf82adf26127.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/c7ca93541ad0d3672dab053f99242854.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/3457137ba40835a061c75517bc9030f8.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/d828eb81c9259e80709ec0c6ed7bca9b.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/ebd194a6ba0d5a96292d94b3ed664d76.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/7427ecdbff26c5924d120ee80bf1c1a1.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/304bf52a8bb443d762c6cec140c653e8.avif?t=1787509442\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonings          Luxuries              Sundries              Fabrics                Livestock             Alcohol               Weapons</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >and many more...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/14ed4c5b12d782979f1575dbe864a440.poster.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1170 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/14ed4c5b12d782979f1575dbe864a440.webm?t=1787509442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/14ed4c5b12d782979f1575dbe864a440.mp4?t=1787509442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/4c70a058c418652e17a05a8f1008a381.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/a428c74042006bdf905fa1ab7486f7f9.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wealth in The Medieval Journey is not created in isolation, but through a living world driven by players, supply and demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources vary in value between regions, creating opportunities for craftsmen and traders alike. What is abundant in one city may be rare and highly sought after in another. By mastering production, understanding markets and moving goods across trade routes, you can build a fortune through strategy rather than combat alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From raw materials to finished goods, from local workshops to long-distance caravans—every step of the economy is shaped by the people who live in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/f958acd610a7df010fd90d031e0df6f2.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/02055be2962c9733f604e49ca1b0c00f.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/02055be2962c9733f604e49ca1b0c00f.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=831 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/12e918202863001e73765d36ef13c780.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey from humble beginnings and grow into a life defined by success, reputation and influence. Own property, run businesses and accumulate wealth that shapes not only your own future, but also that of your descendants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As generations pass, your family continues what you have built—expanding its reach, preserving its name and growing its legacy across the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/8573bd53634e945594262e7dae5491c6.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/5d7a9dd5f860431cc7e2057060779dec.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Medieval Journey is more than a solo experience—it is a living world shaped by its community. Form guilds, establish trade networks and build alliances that influence the economy and social landscape of entire regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with others to craft, trade and explore, or compete for influence across cities and markets. Every interaction contributes to a world that evolves through the actions of its players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/aa2a3eb4fa19ae997ec306b7b9e0370e.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/859668fa656f77b993cfda60cb1ed295.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Multi-Generational Dynasty System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Marriage, Children and Inheritance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Character Aging and Permanent Legacy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Historical Medieval German Cities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Deep Profession and Crafting Systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Player-Driven Economy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Regional Trading Networks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Dynamic Social Relationships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Family Reputation and Influence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Cooperative Multiplayer Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Guilds and Alliances</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Persistent Online World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/17f096d16ac0fe8456d437dbaed7c033.avif?t=1787509442\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You may begin as a simple blacksmith.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your grandson may become the wealthiest merchant in the realm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your family name may be remembered for centuries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Medieval Journey is not the story of a single hero.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It is the story of a dynasty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras/9c8533577e7eb2a634d0599eb9de4870.avif?t=1787509442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/extras_big/9c8533577e7eb2a634d0599eb9de4870.webp?t=1787509442 width=1560 height=779 /></span></p>", "short_description": "The Medieval Journey is a living medieval MMORPG where generations shape the world. Build relationships, marry, raise children and continue your family's legacy through the ages. Master professions, create thriving businesses, trade across authentic historical cities and forge a dynasty.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/554610b1257b646300111d032218d15db7aade84/header.jpg?t=1787509442", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/79fae9edf0b292b644ce43e904beffc11a85d426/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787509442", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868880/79fae9edf0b292b644ce43e904beffc11a85d426/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787509442", "website": "https://themedievaljourney.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul c